{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19172","headline":"河南白尹有喜崔宾客归洛兼见怀长句因而继和 · 刘禹锡","name":"河南白尹有喜崔宾客归洛兼见怀长句因而继和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年侍从作名臣，却向青云索得身。\n朝士忽爲方外士，主人仍是眼中人。\n双鸾游处天京好，五马行时海峤春。\n遥羡光阴不虚掷，肯令丝竹暂生尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}